5 "Using the linearity and additivity of double integrals, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{C\\cup D}3f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A & =3{∬}_{C\\cup D}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A \\\\  & =3({∬}_{C}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A+{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A) \\\\  & =3(12-8) \\\\  & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331651 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331652 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331653 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331654 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331655 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1041 "selection" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331651 13194139535108 true] [17592186331650 1110 #uuid "9ce1bfa0-20a6-5068-8b84-06cc21216d1c" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331651 1034 "12" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331651 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331651 1111 #uuid "f2ce9cf6-cb89-5925-be70-58d120a18f3b" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331652 1034 "20" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331652 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331652 1111 #uuid "a9864cbf-6a64-53cc-ab8e-c71fa558a57d" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331653 1034 "60" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331653 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331653 1111 #uuid "3a758cc8-944e-5221-8cb4-2dff9b804d63" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331654 1034 "8" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331654 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331654 1111 #uuid "76966019-65c6-5468-9ee2-9d79dbf3bfbb" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331655 1034 "24" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331655 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331655 1111 #uuid "cb6f7c7e-5ffb-562c-95fb-be585d8fd4ac" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331656 1017 #edb/ref 17592186331657 13194139535108 tr