s:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R & =(1,2)\\times ((1,2)\\cup (2,4)) \\\\  & =((1,2)\\times (1,2))\\cup ((1,2)\\times (2,4)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{(1,2)\\times (1,2)}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (2,4)}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{(1,2)\\times (1,2)}\\frac{y+1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (2,4)}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331665 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331666 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331667 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331668 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331669 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1041 "selection" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331666 13194139535108 true] [17592186331664 1110 #uuid "024c2b39-8277-583c-ac44-4c2691bc49bb" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331665 1034 "{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (1,2)}\\frac{y+1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(2,4)\\times (2,4)}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331665 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331665 1111 #uuid "d5f9e260-1a1d-579f-9b57-a15fbd84f7ad" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331666 1034 "{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (1,2)}\\frac{y+1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (2,4)}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331666 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331666 1111 #uuid "0b5a9024-0e75-5ff5-ac3a-62b813e9d335" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331667 1034 "{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (1,4)}(\\frac{y+1}{1+{x}^{2}}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}})\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139535108 true] [17592186331667 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535108 true] [17592186331667 1111 #uuid "a3d82e3c-5c20-54ab-aa37-e417510f61b3" 13194139535108 true] [175